Package: worldbank
Title: Worldbank Financial Indicators
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Dimitrios", "Zacharatos", , "dzacharatos@yahoo.com", role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0003-1789-8294"))
Author: Dimitrios Zacharatos [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Dimitrios Zacharatos <dzacharatos@yahoo.com>
Depends: R (>= 3.5.0), shiny, magrittr
Imports: DT, dplyr, plotly
Description: An interactive 'shiny' application for exploring World Bank
    development indicators (economic, social and demographic) for countries
    worldwide from 1960 onwards. Indicators can be compared across countries
    or across indicators over time, and shown as bar plots, scatter plots,
    world maps and population pyramids built with 'plotly', with a
    searchable index of all indicators built with 'DT'. The cleaned data
    from World Bank Open Data <https://data.worldbank.org> ship with the
    package.
